        <mxCell id="c142" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined in coral: the largest difference from the expectation, promotion 2 (Accessories), 11.9%, which is 1.65 standard deviations. Outlined in teal: the smallest, promotion 3 (Strategic), -20.7%. The three promotions of 2024 have no year earlier, so their comparison reads n/a. Volume is the list amount ordered in the scope. Column J, the standard deviation as a share of the mean, is hidden.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="407" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
